      "comment": "MONEY TALKS (6) went back last start then worked home in good style to finish 1.2 metres from the winner in second at this track over 1690m, adding to some strong performances of late. Recent efforts are good enough to win a race of this calibre. LITTLE TEDEY (8) saluted two runs back then things went sour last time when he broke and finished 10 metres back in fourth over 1690m at this track. Can travel in a nice spot from this draw and wait on the sprint lane if necessary. Won't find this any harder so he can return to winning ways. FLING IT RAINBOW (7) is better than his last-start seventh over 1690m at this track. LOVE WHO (4) showed pleasing improvement last time out when runner-up over 2180m at this track.",
